{%- comment -%}
BLACK WEEK 2026 · PDP gift row ("Gåvor under Black Week": the 799/1299 kr. gifts; the Thermo bottle was removed 19.11), rendered inside snippet bw-pdp-mechanic.
Not shown for tape products (design: "ingen gaveblok ved tape"): hidden when the product title, handle or
product type contains "tape", or when the product has the tag "bw-ingen-gave".
Params: product
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bw_gift_hide = false
  assign bw_t = product.title | append: ' ' | append: product.handle | append: ' ' | append: product.type | downcase
  if bw_t contains 'tape' or product.tags contains 'bw-ingen-gave'
    assign bw_gift_hide = true
  endif
-%}
{%- unless bw_gift_hide -%}
  <div class="bw-pdp-gift">
    <div class="bw-pdp-gift__img">
      {%- assign bw_gift_img = images['hyrdrationbottle.png'] -%}
      {%- if bw_gift_img != blank -%}
        {{ bw_gift_img | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'AROX vattenflaska 1000 ml' }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="bw-pdp-gift__txt">
      <div class="bw-pdp-gift__k">Gåvor under Black Week</div>
      <div class="bw-pdp-gift__v">Gratis vattenflaska från 1 199 kr och strumpor 3-pack från 1 999 kr. Gäller även med 3 för 2 och 4 för 2.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endunless -%}
